    <string name="cannabis_info_joint">When smoking a joint about 23%% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke a joint with 300mg of a bud that has 20%% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 23/100 = 13.8mg THC.</string>
    <string name="cannabis_info_bong">When smoking with a bong about 40%% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke 300mg of a bud that has 20%% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 40/100 = 24mg THC.</string>
    <string name="cannabis_info_vaporizer">When smoking with a vaporizer about 70%% of the THC in the bud is inhaled. So if you smoke 300mg of a bud that has 20%% THC then you inhale 300mg * 20/100 * 70/100 = 42mg THC.</string>
    <string name="psilocybin_info_dried">Dried Psilocybe cubensis contain around 1%% of Psilocybin.</string>
    <string name="psilocybin_info_fresh">Fresh Psilocybe cubensis contain around 0.1%% of Psilocybin.</string>
    <string name="psilocybin_info_research">Research the strain of mushroom you have to be able to estimate the amount of Psilocybin it contains.</string>
    <string name="alcohol_info">1 ml of Ethanol is 0.8g. So if you are e.g. consuming 200ml of a spirit with 40%% of Alcohol you are consuming 200ml * 40/100 * 0.8 = 64g Ethanol.</string>
